8px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ví dụ:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">白马</span>&nbsp;(白馬)。Bái mǎ. Ngựa trắng</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">大马</span>&nbsp;(大馬). Dà mǎ. Ngựa to</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">好马</span>&nbsp;(好馬)。Hǎo mǎ. Ngựa tốt.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cách ghi nhớ từ vựng nhanh qua ý nghĩa</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">你</span>&nbsp;(nǐ) bạn, chữ 你&nbsp;được tạo thành bởi 3 bộ, gồm: bộ nhân đứng(亻) chỉ người, bộ mịch(冖) là dải lụa và bộ tiểu(小) là nhỏ. 3 bộ này ghép lại với nhau được chữ 你 ý nghĩa là người mà từ nhỏ quấn chung dải lụa thì là bạn.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">好</span>(hǎo) tốt, chữ 好 gồm 2 bộ đó là bộ nữ(女) chỉ người phụ nữ và bộ tử(子) là con trai. theo quan niệm thời xưa người phụ nữ sinh được con trai là chuyện tốt.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">一</span>&nbsp;(yī) Hán Việt đọc là nhất, người Việt Nam chúng ta cũng thường xuyên sử dụng từ Hán Việt này cho nên rất dễ để ghi nhớ.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">五</span>( wǔ) nhìn khá giống với số 5 nhưng 五 vuông và nhiều nét hơn.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">八</span>&nbsp;(bā) số 8 một con số may mắn trong quan niệm của cả người Trung Quốc và người Việt Nam.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">大</span>&nbsp;(dà) to lớn, một người đang dang rộng hai tay hai chân nhìn thật to lớn.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">白</span>&nbsp;(bái) trắng, bên trên nét phẩy bên dưới chữ nhật (日).</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">女</span>&nbsp;(nǚ) phụ nữ, một người phụ nữ đang đi gánh nước.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Bộ thủ trong Giáo trình Hán ngữ bài 1 quyển 1</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ nhân đứng(亻) chỉ người.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ mịch(冖) là dải lụa, quàng khăn lên.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ tiểu(小) là nhỏ, bé.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ nữ(女) chỉ người phụ nữ.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ tử(子) là con trai.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Bộ Bạch (白) là màu trắng.</li></ul><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"5_Ngu_phap\" ez-toc-data-id=\"#5_Ngu_phap\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\"></span>#5. Ngữ pháp<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\"></span></h2><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Trong Ngữ pháp Bài 1 Giáo trình Hán ngữ quyển 1 có 4 điểm cần lưu ý:</p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-size: 22px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\">?️ #1. Cách chào hỏi tiếng Trung</h3><blockquote style=\"margin: 1em; background: rgb(252, 247, 212); border-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: rgb(245, 223, 82); border-image: initial; padding: 1em 2em 0.1em; list-style: none; outline: none; color: rgb(239, 118, 79); font-size: 15px; border-radius: 15px; line-height: 26px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px;\">? Cấu trúc: [Danh xưng/người cần chào] + 好！(hǎo) (Chào ai đó bằng cách thêm “好” sau danh xưng.)</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ví dụ:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">你好</span>！ (Nǐ hǎo!) → Xin chào! (Chào một người)</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">老师好</span>！ (Lǎoshī hǎo!) → Chào cô/thầy!</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">爸爸好</span>！ (Bàba hǎo!) → Chào bố!</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">妈妈好</span>！ (Māma hǎo!) → Chào mẹ!</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">? Mở rộng:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Chào nhiều người:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">你们好</span>！ (Nǐmen hǎo!) → Chào các bạn!</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Chào lịch sự, trang trọng:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">您好</span>！ (Nín hǎo!) → Chào ông/bà/ngài! (Dùng khi nói với người lớn tuổi hoặc thể hiện sự tôn trọng.)</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-size: 22px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\">#2. Cách dùng câu hỏi “phải không?” với 吗？</h3><blockquote style=\"margin: 1em; background: rgb(252, 247, 212); border-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: rgb(245, 223, 82); border-image: initial; padding: 1em 2em 0.1em; list-style: none; outline: none; color: rgb(239, 118, 79); font-size: 15px; border-radius: 15px; line-height: 26px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px;\">? Cấu trúc: [Khẳng định] + 吗？(ma) (Chỉ cần thêm 吗 vào cuối câu khẳng định để tạo thành câu hỏi “phải không?”.)</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ví dụ:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">你好吗</span>？ (Nǐ hǎo ma?) → Bạn khỏe không?</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">大吗</span>？ (Dà ma?) → To không?</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">白吗</span>？ (Bái ma?) → Trắng không?</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">好吗</span>？ (Hǎo ma?) → Tốt/được không?</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">? Lưu ý:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Trả lời Đúng/Phải: 是 (shì) hoặc 对 (duì).</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Trả lời Không: 不是 (bú shì) hoặc 不对 (bú duì).</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-size: 22px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\">#3. Cách dùng từ “không” với 不</h3><blockquote style=\"margin: 1em; background: rgb(252, 247, 212); border-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: rgb(245, 223, 82); border-image: initial; padding: 1em 2em 0.1em; list-style: none; outline: none; color: rgb(239, 118, 79); font-size: 15px; border-radius: 15px; line-height: 26px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px;\">? Cấu trúc: 不 + [Động từ/Tính từ] (Dùng để phủ định động từ hoặc tính từ.)</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ví dụ:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">不大</span>&nbsp;(bù dà) → Không to.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">不好</span>&nbsp;(bù hǎo) → Không tốt, không khỏe, không được.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">不白</span>&nbsp;(bù bái) → Không trắng.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Lưu ý đặc biệt:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">Khi động từ là 有 (yǒu – có) thì dùng 没有 (méiyǒu) thay vì 不有.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\">我没有书。 (Wǒ méiyǒu shū.) → Tôi không có sách.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-size: 22px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none;\">#4. Cách sử dụng tính từ trong tiếng Trung</h3><blockquote style=\"margin: 1em; background: rgb(252, 247, 212); border-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-color: rgb(245, 223, 82); border-image: initial; padding: 1em 2em 0.1em; list-style: none; outline: none; color: rgb(239, 118, 79); font-size: 15px; border-radius: 15px; line-height: 26px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px;\">? Cấu trúc: [Tính từ] + [Danh từ] (Tính từ đứng trước danh từ để bổ nghĩa cho danh từ.)</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ví dụ:</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">白马</span>&nbsp;(bái mǎ) → Ngựa trắng (白: trắng; 马: ngựa)</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">大马</span>&nbsp;(dà mǎ) → Ngựa to (大: to)</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">好马</span>&nbsp;(hǎo mǎ) → Ngựa tốt (好: tốt)</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">? Mở rộng:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Khi tính từ là định ngữ phức tạp hoặc dài hơn 1 chữ, cần dùng 的 (de):</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(44, 47, 52); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">漂亮的衣服</span>&nbsp;(piàoliang de yīfu) → Quần áo đẹp.</li><li style=\"list-style: none disc; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; outline: none;\"><span class=\"docto\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding: 4px 0px 2px 25px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; border: 0px; outline: none; display: inline-block; background-image: url(&quot;https://tiengtrungonline.com/wp-content/themes/chinese/images/volume-do-4-xxl.png&quot;); background-size: 18px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: left center; color: rgb(35, 81, 210);\">聪明的学生</span>&nbsp;(cōngming de xuéshēng) → Học sinh thông minh.</li></ul>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk3',15,'2025-04-11 16:02:55',1,0.00),(94,'HÁN 2 - GIÁO TRÌNH HÁN NGỮ QUYỂN 24','<p>a</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk2',30,'2025-05-22 17:41:49',1,1.00),(95,'HÁN 2 - GIÁO TRÌNH HÁN NGỮ QUYỂN 2','<p>a</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk2',30,'2025-05-22 17:41:49',1,1.00),(97,'HSK 3 CƠ BẢN','<p>HSK 3 dành cho người mới bắt đầu.</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk2',40,'2025-05-22 17:46:00',0,2.50),(98,'LUYỆN NGHE HSK 4 p8','<p>d</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk4',35,'2025-05-22 17:47:00',0,3.00),(99,'NGỮ PHÁP HSK 5','<p>Học chắc ngữ pháp HSK 5.ewrju</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk5',45,'2025-05-22 17:48:00',0,4.50),(100,'ĐỌC HIỂU HSK 6','<p>Luyện đọc nâng cao.</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_nh761wnh761wnh76-1748616492895.png','hsk6',60,'2025-05-22 17:49:00',0,5.00),(101,'LUYỆN ĐỀ HSK 2','<p>Tổng hợp đề thi thử HSK 2.</p>','/images/Gemini_Generated_Image